     "text": "**Short answer:** This is a strong offer for the market, and you should negotiate rather than accept it as-is. But I can't tell you whether to switch yet, because the real comparison isn't Halvern against the market. It's Halvern against what you'd give up at Varrowby, and you haven't told me that.\n\n## How the offer stacks up\n\n| Component | Annual value |\n|---|---|\n| Base | $235,000 |\n| Target bonus | $47,000 |\n| RSUs ($1.08M \u00f7 4) | $270,000 |\n| **Total per year (years 1\u20134)** | **~$552,000** |\n\nFor a rough market check, Levels.fyi shows LinkedIn Senior PMs in the SF Bay Area at a ",
